["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/IsoAutomationLevel/highAutomation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Level 4 - High automation. The system performs parts of its mission without external intervention.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
