["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/standardCompliance", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A free-form text that captures a standard that an artifact complies with.\n\nThe standard may, but is not necessarily required to, satisfy a legal or\nregulatory requirement.\n\nIf the artifact is using a standard as a reference or guideline, but not\nnecessarily compliant with it, use the /Core/standardName property instead.\n\nFor a detailed compliance information, please consider defining\na Relationship with \"conformsTo\" relationship type to a Regulation.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
