["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/hazard", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Hazards are potential sources of harm, danger, or adverse effects to people, property, the environment, or systems within or related to a specific piece of hardware. For example, a lithium battery is a hazardous hardware item.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
