["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/VulnAssessmentRelationship", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "VulnAssessmentRelationship is the ancestor class common to all vulnerability\nassessment relationships. It factors out the common properties shared by them.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
