["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/BoundaryCrossingAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Boundary crossing occurs when an individual, object, or system moves between different defined areas, domains, or disciplines. It can apply to various fields, including education, psychology, business, logistics, and technology.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
