["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/roleQualification", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "roleQualification is an object property that links a Role to one or more Requirement elements.\nIt defines the qualifications\u2014educational, experiential, certification, or competency-based\u2014that an entity must possess to be considered capable of performing the responsibilities associated with the role.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
