["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/SpecificationType/regulation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "A mandatory legal specification issued by a governmental or regulatory authority. Compliance is enforceable by law.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
