["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/actionStatement", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "When an element is referenced with a VexAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship,\nthe relationship shall include one actionStatement that should describe actions\nto remediate or mitigate the vulnerability.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
