["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/verificationPostcondition", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Verification postcondition are explicit criteria, states, or conditions that are true immediately after a verification method (such as a test, inspection, or analysis) has been performed, confirming the successful execution and complete outcomes of the verification.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
