["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/plannedTransportRoute", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A planned path or network taken by people, products, goods, data, or resources.\nThe route varies depending on product type, safety requirements, business\nconstraints, or other factors.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
