["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/container", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The Element is a container image which can be used by a container runtime application.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
